    "id": 1094108,
    "name": "Travel Size Bug Repellent Stick",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Granny Smith all natural bug repellent comes in a no-mess, long-lasting 0.35 oz tube. A little bit goes a long way! &nbsp; Made from just a few good, nourishing ingredients ~ all edible - which means it's safe for you, your children &amp; your pets!</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lemongrass, Peppermint &amp; Rosemary essential oils are VERY EFFECTIVE&nbsp;in repelling ticks, fleas, mosquitos, spiders, lice &amp; many more pests. A family friend tested our bug repellent stick on&nbsp;a group of boy scouts while restocking a fish pond . The report was quite impressive on its efficiency to ward off unwanted insects!</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Made in our home in Oregon - you can’t get any better than that!</span></p>",
